Overview of changes in version 0.7.33:

  - Fixed changing names (when not playing over a network)
  - Fixed writing INI-file (with non-ASCII chars in names) in non-UTF8 locales
  - Fixed changing game-specific menus when switching games


Overview of changes in version 0.7.32:

  - config: Checking for carddecks in more directories
  - Buraco: Test first if card fits on pile, before warning about missing cards
  - Buraco: Undoing undoes moving of jokers caused by last move
  - Buraco: Sorting cards after taking buraco disables undo
  - Buraco: The dumped cards and tose of the reserve  can be shown after game
  - Røvhult: Fixed setting title when not using an ISO-8895-1 encoding


Overview of changes in version 0.7.31:

  - Buraco: Can't end a game, when a pile of jokers is not finished
  - Buraco: Computer doesn't move jokers when card fits, but can't be played
  - Buraco: Fixed computer ending, without having cerrado, when having 6 jokers


